Sun Nov 15 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 0.1.0+git20261115031617.ae3472d-0
- Port umbriel-git from fedora-nexus: nightly snapshot build, links
  wlroots-0.20 in Tumbleweed; vendored umbrielfx (no external SceneFX)
- Align BuildRequires floors with upstream meson.build: libinput >= 1.29,
  xkbcommon >= 1.10.0, explicit pkgconfig(wayland-client)
- Restrict to x86_64 (ExclusiveArch), the only architecture this repository builds
